   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Amortization&#65279; expense related to definite lived intangible assets was $<ix:nonFraction id="c149601278" contextRef="d_2025-10-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">612,751</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149601279" contextRef="d_2024-10-01_2025-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">573,801</ix:nonFraction>&#160;for the <em style="font: inherit;">nine</em>&#160;months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, respectively.</p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
